      "writtenOn": "2024-04-16T17:16:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we assume that if `this-\u003efExternalFormat \u003d\u003d that.fExternalFormat` that they will have the same format feature flags? \n\nI would think yes for a given instance of Skia, but I know we have talked about how the external format numerical representation could change under certain niche circumstances. It doesn\u0027t cost us much to check for equality here, but if we want to be sure they don\u0027t differ between two \"same value\" external formats, then we should add that to the key for conversions.\n\nLMKWYT!",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 89
      },
      "revId": "630b93a3e288d38b2c1aab086b9581538a6f6ebb",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
