      "writtenOn": "2024-04-16T17:25:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will add comment docs for whatever we determine, but I do think that we can assume if one external format \u003d\u003d another that we can ignore the format feature flag equality check since we get the format feature flags from `VkAndroidHardwareBufferFormatPropertiesANDROID` where `externalFormat` is implementation-defined, so I don\u0027t think that implementation should be changing at runtime.",
