      "writtenOn": "2024-04-16T17:26:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where is this value coming from? Is it something we\u0027re getting or is it passed in by the client? Also are these features something that actually goes into creating the VkYCBCRConversionInfo? Like I get we need to store it and reference it, but could we use the same sampler that had different format features?",
